### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 86/100.** Evidence Tau2 90%+ lineage; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 88/100.** Evidence MMLU Pro 84%+ lineage; GPQA 87%+; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 96/100.** 1M / 131K out — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 70/100.** Text, image, video in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 87/100.** Evidence LiveCodeBench ~87.8 High; SWE-Verified 70%+ lineage; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 50/100.** Paid ~$2/$6 per 1M (Alibaba).
- **Overall Score: 85/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (86+88+96+70+87)/5=85.4 → 85; best-fit per scoring methodology.

